{
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "combo-s-nav",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# 玩家普攻｜结构图\nPlayerCombo持有原激活内的段序、输入请求和Task／窗口／移动资源。\nASC持有原请求与终止认证；Animation提供Montage／姿态契约；CMC唯一执行胶囊位移；Combat查询并去重命中。\n[[计划_玩家普攻连段|连段说明]] · [[AbilitySystem/结构|GAS结构]] · [[GGYGO_流程_玩家普攻连段.canvas|连段流程]]",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 1510,
      "height": 190,
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "combo-s-ga",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## UGGYGOPlayerComboAbility\n持原Activation、段序／请求号、FStepMotionResources、Task和Owned窗口。\nStartStep(Original,Index,Position,RequestId)：原激活与段配置→播放／移动／FX资源。\nHandleMontageNotify按名解释独立AttackGate／MovementGate；HandleInputPressed消费真实新请求。\n攻击点只接续；移动许可须到Main实际末端。\nCleanupAbilityResourcesForTermination(Context)：原终止上下文→释放匹配资源。\n[[AbilitySystem/结构#原请求终止|生命周期接口]]",
      "x": 530,
      "y": 280,
      "width": 450,
      "height": 390,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "combo-s-config",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## FGGYGOComboStep[]／生产GA\nMontage、Main／End、MotionSlotName／Scale、NextStepIndex与PlayRate。\nInterruptionMode／InterruptionNotifyName管攻击；MovementInterruptionMode／NotifyName管移动；启用点须异名。\nDamage／DamageMultiplier／PoiseDamage、TraceShape及FX为段配置。\nValidateComboConfiguration：配置→来源／点／数值有效结果或诊断。\nDisabled关闭对应门；Next=NONE无攻击接续；InputBufferSeconds仅存序列化值。",
      "x": 1060,
      "y": 280,
      "width": 450,
      "height": 340,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "combo-s-task",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## Montage／输入／FX Task\nGA持各原Task与token；WaitComboInput给SourceStep／RequestId。\nConfigureOriginalMontageNotifies：Ready前配置启用的异名点。\nNotifyReceived给原Mesh／Montage／整数实例及作者／trigger；ByName快照给对应点与实际位置。\nMontage Task持Playback／Guard／scale／Ticket及订阅；GA持两门和FX Task。\nTask退自身资源；原失败事实交GA正式结束。\n[[AbilitySystem/结构#原生 Montage 作者信号|Task接口]]",
      "x": 530,
      "y": 750,
      "width": 450,
      "height": 390,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "combo-s-anim",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## Animation Source / Required Pose / CMC\nBuildSourceBindingRange冻结原Main→End连续来源；CMC BeginMontageActionMotion / native RMS唯一执行XYZ胶囊。\nQuery/SubscribeQualifiedMovementIntent发布原Scope真实资格；CancelMontageActionMotionForMovement只退原Handle。\nNotifyMontageActionNaturalBlendOut许可原有限尾区间；ObserveMontageActionMotionCompletion发布末贡献消费事实。\nActionPoseSlot保留Body−Trajectory−MeshRef全XYZ姿态余量；Guard/节点求值归Animation，Task只持Ticket。\n[[Animation/动作姿态修正|姿态执行]] · [[Movement/结构|移动契约]]",
      "x": 1060,
      "y": 750,
      "width": 450,
      "height": 330,
      "color": "1"
    },
    {
      "id": "combo-s-network",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 强类型纠正与完成接口\nFGGYGOComboCorrectionData由Combo定义，包含段／位置／窗口／Revision；ASC只按Spec/key路由TargetData。\nReceiveAbilityCorrection：强类型载荷→本段纠正；Combo负责类型、范围及Revision校验。\nCurrentStepRequestId属于当前段请求，按请求号区分新旧接受，段序允许03→01。\nRequestAbilityEnd／Cancel：固定Original→原终止结果。\nGA结束数据、ASC本地通知与TerminationCompletedNotice分别描述各自生命周期边界。\n[[AbilitySystem/结构#原请求终止|完成接口与权限]]",
      "x": 530,
      "y": 1230,
      "width": 650,
      "height": 390,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "combo-s-input",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 输入请求接口\nIA_Attack配置Pressed；ASC活跃Spec的InputPressed由WaitComboInput消费。\nWaitComboInput输出SourceStep／RequestId；PlayerCombo拥有段内打断许可与NextStepIndex决策。\n输入Task只提供输入事实，不持有GA打断门。\nCMC的QualifiedMovementIntent提供原Source／Scope的移动资格；Combo持有自己的资格订阅。\n激活重试的请求、许可与等待归ASC；Hero持自身Action观察与输入请求关联。\n[[Input/结构|输入职责]]",
      "x": -300,
      "y": 280,
      "width": 450,
      "height": 300,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "combo-s-hit",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## MeleeTrace／Builder／GE／Cue\nHero持MeleeTraceComponent；Combat持窗口、采样及去重。\nTryOpenOwnedTraceWindow／SubscribeWindowHit：查询配置→Window及Actor／HitResult事实。\nGA持窗口和订阅，核原激活／段／Task／Window。\nBuilder每命中创建Spec；GA按返回GE模式写绝对值或倍率、独立削韧，再经ASC应用。\nUnsubscribeWindowHit／CloseOwnedTraceWindow归还原查询资源。\n[[Combat/结构|查询契约]] · [[GGYGO_流程_伤害结算.canvas|伤害流程]]",
      "x": -260,
      "y": 750,
      "width": 450,
      "height": 390,
      "color": "4"
    }
  ],
  "edges": [
    {
